[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2486193109","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99366#issuecomment-2486193109","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99366","id":2486193109,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6UMEvV","user":{"login":"QbieShay","id":7917475,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MTc0NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7917475?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay","html_url":"https://github.com/QbieShay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-19T16:30:12Z","updated_at":"2024-11-19T16:30:12Z","body":"What change was veto'd? I see no harm in an intensity slider. I would see harm in adding an intensity field in Color, but that's not what this PR does","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2486193109/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2486206767","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99366#issuecomment-2486206767","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99366","id":2486206767,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6UMIEv","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-19T16:36:05Z","updated_at":"2024-11-19T16:36:33Z","body":"The way it's exposed in this PR seems less risky than what https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/1031 originally envisioned, since it's only available in RAW mode and does not impact the RGB/HSV modes in any way.\r\n\r\nThe downside is that you can't use HSV editing while having an HDR intensity slider on the same page, but you can switch to RAW mode after editing your HSL color and use the intensity slider there.\r\n\r\nI also agree with keeping the hexadecimal field visible whenever the color isn't overbright too.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2486206767/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2488418173","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99366#issuecomment-2488418173","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99366","id":2488418173,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6UUj99","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-20T12:09:21Z","updated_at":"2024-11-20T12:09:21Z","body":">Switching to RAW mode increases the dialog's height, which can cause the bottom of the dialog to be unreachable if it spawns at the bottom of a window:\r\n\r\nI think it's acceptable, clicking \"Swatches\" or \"Recent colors\" increases the dialog's height as well.\r\n\r\n>The icon when the color is overbright doesn't display correctly in the running project:\r\n\r\nI have fixed it in the running project. However, in editor the 2d screen it still can't display correctly, for which I don't have a solution at the moment.\r\n\r\n>Switching to the OKHSL Circle picker will result in broken rendering if you were in the RAW mode and intensity is over 1 (this isn't a new issue IIRC, but it's easier to achieve now):\r\n\r\nIt seems due to the incorrect value of HSV.  #99461 should fix it.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2488418173/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2488502529","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99366#issuecomment-2488502529","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99366","id":2488502529,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6UU4kB","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-20T12:50:20Z","updated_at":"2024-11-20T12:52:01Z","body":"I've tested the latest revision of this PR and noticed the color picker can have its hex/code toggle button permanently locked if you raise the intensity above 1 then lower it below 1. Closing and reopening the ColorPicker doesn't fix the issue, you need to reload the saved scene:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/289f9a18-d0cf-4cf2-ab5e-647498f85870)\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dff158d2-9ff4-4cf2-803f-05ea1fb75271\r\n\r\nThe `#` symbol is also not clickable anymore in the running project, and no symbol appears when the color is overbright:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/340a363a-477c-41ea-93e2-e4c281c6da9e)\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ec675280-5c15-4bc8-b75a-ea073d736edd)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2488502529/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2494042569","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99366#issuecomment-2494042569","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99366","id":2494042569,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6UqBHJ","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-22T15:36:38Z","updated_at":"2024-11-22T15:36:38Z","body":"The button to switch between hexadecimal and code works now, but the button becomes invisible once you switch to code (it's still clickable):\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0ae8fb5f-0056-458e-b4b9-25ac7ec5b0f2)\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2494042569/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2496783056","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99366#issuecomment-2496783056","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99366","id":2496783056,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6U0eLQ","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-25T04:39:16Z","updated_at":"2024-11-25T04:39:16Z","body":">The button to switch between hexadecimal and code works now, but the button becomes invisible once you switch to code (it's still clickable):\r\n\r\nIt's as expected, because the \"Script\" icon is only available in the editor. To make it available at